Ok, done, and done.  It was plenty easy, I did essentially what you 
mentioned (I still haven't seen the ttyrec for it)

At any given time, my hp (now at a max of 143) never really dropped below 
100, just about every successful level drain caused Kaen to flee to the 
stairs.  Then I'd go back to his lair and heal.  Magicbane was handy to 
Elbereth the stairs in his lair, to keep things off of me while I healed. 
So I'd suggest bringing something to engrave with quickly.  Having your 
prayer timeout ready might be a good plan too.  Anyway, it was _much_ easier 
than I anticipated





